OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fin east, otherwise cloudy with
OL,7,Foccasional rain, with some heavier
OL,8,Foutbreaks developing overnight,
OL,9,Fturning showery towards morning. Fresh
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds along the east coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,13,Fa few showers, these showers more so
OL,14,Fover Moray, with the best of the
OL,15,Fsunshine towards Aberdeen and the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,18,Fintervals and some heavy showers on
OL,19,FSaturday, breezy. Mainly dry and
OL,20,Fbright Sunday, winds easing. Monday
OL,21,Fclouding over with some patchy rain.
